  "implemented": [
    "Separate OFD JVM handles archive, XML, font/image decoding and every page before writing a result",
    "One shared PDF/OFD process slot; fixed commands and cleared inherited environment; private temporary/user directory",
    "Bounded waits and force-stop on timeout/interruption, preserve caller interrupt, cleanup only owned directory after confirmed stop",
    "Do not release slot when a worker cannot be stopped; nonzero exit never reaches result reader",
    "Validate complete result envelope and fixed PNG header/tail without decompressing images in parent",
    "Real boot executable JAR uses PropertiesLauncher; child clears additional loader.path",
    "Trusted explicit font catalog supported internally, including spaced paths and next-call digest revalidation"
